          "finish_reason": "stop",
          "prompt_tokens": 31,
          "completion_tokens": 94,
          "reasoning_tokens": 21,
          "content_chars": 74,
          "content": "**BF16 牺牲精度（7位尾数）保留 FP32 同等的动态范围（8位指数），而 FP16 牺牲动态范围（5位指数）保留更高精度（10位尾数）。**"
        },
        {
          "name": "03_smoke2",
          "prompt": "List three differences between Mamba-2 state space layers and softmax attention, in English, under 120 words.",
          "max_tokens": 256,
          "temperature": 0,
          "wall_secs": 5.42,
          "finish_reason": "stop",
          "prompt_tokens": 42,
          "completion_tokens": 209,
          "reasoning_tokens": 29,
          "content_chars": 846,
          "content": "1. **Complexity Scaling**: Mamba-2 processes sequences in linear time $O(N)$ and constant memory via recurrent state updates, whereas softmax attention requires quadratic time $O(N^2)$ and memory due to the pairwise token interaction matrix.\n\n2. **Context Compression**: Mamba-2 compresses history into a fixed-size latent state (SSM), inevitably discarding fine-grained details over long horizons. S"
        }
      ]
    },
